@participant4 @participant3 A spring release is planned, see also here https://github.com/onnx/steering-committee/blob/main/meeting-notes/2025/20250205.md, it's a bit delayed, but there should be a release branch soon.

The release will contain normal python 3.13 support, but probably not yet for 3.13t (Or more precisely prepared wheels for 3.13 but probably not yet for 3.13t) 

To be sure, are you talking about both 3.13 and 3.13t (the free threading variant) and you need both?
